OL,3,GNEWSAMan guilty of murdering woman he  
OL,4,Agroomed on fetish site                 
OL,6,FA man has been found guilty of the     
OL,7,Fkidnap and murder of a woman who he    
OL,8,Fgroomed on a fetish website.           
OL,10,FDwain Hall, 54, convinced 32-year-old  
OL,11,FSonia Exelby from Southsea, Hampshire, 
OL,12,Fto travel to the United States where he
OL,13,Fstabbed her to death.                  
OL,15,FOn Friday he was found guilty following
OL,16,Fa trial at a court in Ocala, Florida,  
OL,17,Fof kidnap and first-degree murder. He  
OL,18,Fwas then sentenced to life in prison.  
